native_tools.description:
Worst-margin items

Get worst-margin menu items grouped by location and daypart

### Responses:

**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)
Content-Type: application/json

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "menu_item_id": 1,
      "menu_item_display_name": "Menu Item Display Name"
    }
  ]
}
```

List suppliers

List suppliers with optional name filter

### Responses:

**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)
Content-Type: application/json

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "suppliers": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Name"
    }
  ]
}
```

