List cost cache

List menu item cost cache entries

### Responses:

**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)
Content-Type: application/json

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "cost_cache_entries": [
    {
      "menu_item_id": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

Clone menu

Clone a menu with sections and items

### Responses:

**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)
Content-Type: application/json

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "new_menu": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Name",
    "is_template": 1
  },
  "cloned_sections": [
    {
      "old_section_id": 1,
      "new_section_id": 1,
      "name": "Name",
      "position": 1
    }
  ],
  "cloned_section_items": [
    {
      "old_section_item_id": 1,
      "new_section_item_id": 1,
      "new_section_id": 1,
      "menu_item_id": 1,
      "position": 1
    }
  ]
}
```
